    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droids\" title=\"Droids\">Droids</a></i> </p><p>A&nbsp;2nd-Degree&nbsp;or&nbsp;Class Two<b> </b>Droid&nbsp;is a&nbsp;Droid&nbsp;programmed for&nbsp;engineering&nbsp;and&nbsp;technical&nbsp;sciences. Such Droids tend to perform tasks such as environmental work and&nbsp;Starship&nbsp;repair. </p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"2nd-Degree_Droid_Traits\">2nd-Degree Droid Traits</span></h3><p>2nd-Degree Droids have the following traits: </p><ul>\n <li><b>Ability Modifiers:</b> All 2nd-Degree Droids receive a +2 bonus to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a>, but suffer a -2 penalty to their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>.</li> \n <li><b>Behavioral Inhibitors:</b> 2nd-Degree Droids firstly cannot knowingly harm a sentient creature, unless another creature would be harmed due to inaction. 2nd-Degree Droids secondly obey orders from their designated owner (whether that be an actual owner or themselves).</li> \n <li><b>Droid Traits:</b> All 2nd-Degree Droids posses <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid_Traits\" title=\"Droid Traits\">Droid Traits</a>.</li> \n <li><b>Droid Talents:</b> All 2nd-Degree Droids can select <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid_Talents\" title=\"Droid Talents\">Droid Talents</a> from the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/2nd-Degree_Droid_Talent_Tree\" title=\"2nd-Degree Droid Talent Tree\">2nd-Degree Droid Talent Tree</a>.</li>\n</ul><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/R2-Series_Astromech_Droid\" title=\"R2-Series Astromech Droid\">R2-Series Astromech Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Additional_2nd-Degree_Droids\">Additional 2nd-Degree Droids</span></h2><p>The below details all 2nd-Degree Droid Models found within the <i>Star Wars Saga Edition</i> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reference_Books\" title=\"Reference Books\">Reference Books</a>. </p><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Threats_of_the_Galaxy\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Threats of the Galaxy\">Threats of the Galaxy</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/R2-R-Series_Astromech_Droid\" title=\"R2-R-Series Astromech Droid\">R2-R-Series Astromech Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td><i>Image Unavailable</i> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/R3-Series_Astromech_Droid\" title=\"R3-Series Astromech Droid\">R3-Series Astromech Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/R4-Series_Astromech_Droid\" title=\"R4-Series Astromech Droid\">R4-Series Astromech Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/R5-Series_Astromech_Droid\" title=\"R5-Series Astromech Droid\">R5-Series Astromech Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/R7-Series_Astromech_Droid\" title=\"R7-Series Astromech Droid\">R7-Series Astromech Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide\">Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>Droids play an important part in any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Old_Republic_Campaign\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Old Republic Campaign\">Old Republic Campaign</a>. Droids are just as prominent during the days of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Old_Republic\" title=\"The Old Republic\">The Old Republic</a> as they are in later years, and many models are the obvious predecessors of Droids used during the Galactic Civil War. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th> <p>DROID MODEL </p> </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/G0-T0_Infrastructure-Planning_Droid\" title=\"G0-T0 Infrastructure-Planning Droid\">G0-T0 Infrastructure-Planning Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/T3-Series_Utility_Droid\" title=\"T3-Series Utility Droid\">T3-Series Utility Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>Always a common sight, 2nd-Degree Droids exploded in popularity and sales shortly after the Clone Wars. The race for better <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starfighters\" title=\"Starfighters\">Starfighters</a> had begun to result in numerous designs that featured Astromech Droid work sockets, requiring at least one Astromech per <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starfighter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starfighter\">Starfighter</a>. Additionally, many repair facilities became Empire-controlled establishments featuring customs officers and careful credentials checks, encouraging fringe pilots to do more repairs on their own- for which Technical Droids are a huge help. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/IT-0_Interrogator_Droid\" title=\"IT-0 Interrogator Droid\">IT-0 Interrogator Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Q7-Series_Astromech_Droid\" title=\"Q7-Series Astromech Droid\">Q7-Series Astromech Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>The Clone Wars saw the rapid development of Droid technology, mainly due to the Separatists' heavy reliance on Droid military units. The&nbsp;Droids&nbsp;presented in this chapter are some of the models found in use in nonmilitary capacities. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th> <p>DROID MODEL </p> </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/FA-4_Pilot_Droid\" title=\"FA-4 Pilot Droid\">FA-4 Pilot Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/LE-Series_Repair_Droid\" title=\"LE-Series Repair Droid\">LE-Series Repair Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/P2-Series_Astromech_Droid\" title=\"P2-Series Astromech Droid\">P2-Series Astromech Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pit_Droid\" title=\"Pit Droid\">Pit Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>The following&nbsp;Droids&nbsp;are common sights across the galaxy during&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Legacy_Era\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Legacy Era\">The Legacy Era</a>. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th> <p>DROID MODEL </p> </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/FEG-Series_Pilot_Droid\" title=\"FEG-Series Pilot Droid\">FEG-Series Pilot Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Holocam_Droid\" title=\"Holocam Droid\">Holocam Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Roving_Eye_Observation_Droid\" title=\"Roving Eye Observation Droid\">Roving Eye Observation Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rebellion Era Campaign Guide\">Rebellion Era Campaign Guide</a></span></h3><p>2nd-Degree Droids were the focus of the most impressive technological advances during&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Rebellion_Era\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Rebellion Era\">The Rebellion Era</a>, in large part because of the need to maintain older equipment coupled with the increasing importance of&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starfighter\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starfighter\">Starfighter</a>&nbsp;combat. Astromech and Repair Droids are strong sellers for all companies that manufacture them, as are kits to repair, upgrade, or modify existing Droids. Many of the most successful 2nd-Degree Droids incorporate simple designs that empathize durability and flexibility. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th> <p>DROID MODEL </p> </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/R4-Series_Agromech_Droid\" title=\"R4-Series Agromech Droid\">R4-Series Agromech Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/WED_Treadwell\" title=\"WED Treadwell\">WED Treadwell</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galaxy_at_War\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Galaxy_at_War\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Galaxy at War\">Galaxy at War</a></span></h3><p>Although soldiers are loath to admit it, Droids can be invaluable assets in battle, whether as support or as front-line combatants. Even in eras when Droids are less common or distrusted- such as <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Dark_Times\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Dark Times\">The Dark Times</a>- they are still utilized in some fashion. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th> <p>DROID MODEL </p> </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/KDY-4_Tech_Droid\" title=\"KDY-4 Tech Droid\">KDY-4 Tech Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span id=\"Scavenger.27s_Guide_to_Droids\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Scavenger's_Guide_to_Droids\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Scavenger's Guide to Droids\">Scavenger's Guide to Droids</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th> <p>DROID MODEL </p> </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/EI-9_Network_Security_Droid\" title=\"EI-9 Network Security Droid\">EI-9 Network Security Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 8 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/G2_Repair_Droid\" title=\"G2 Repair Droid\">G2 Repair Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/H-1ME_Battle_Mechanic_Droid\" title=\"H-1ME Battle Mechanic Droid\">H-1ME Battle Mechanic Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/M38-Series_Explorer_Droid\" title=\"M38-Series Explorer Droid\">M38-Series Explorer Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 2 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/MK-Series_Maintenance_Droid\" title=\"MK-Series Maintenance Droid\">MK-Series Maintenance Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/PG-5_Gunnery_Droid\" title=\"PG-5 Gunnery Droid\">PG-5 Gunnery Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/R8-Series_Astromech_Droid\" title=\"R8-Series Astromech Droid\">R8-Series Astromech Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/RX-Series_Pilot_Droid\" title=\"RX-Series Pilot Droid\">RX-Series Pilot Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/S19_Astromech_Droid\" title=\"S19 Astromech Droid\">S19 Astromech Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/V6-Series_Pilot_Droid\" title=\"V6-Series Pilot Droid\">V6-Series Pilot Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galaxy_of_Intrigue\"><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Galaxy of Intrigue\">Galaxy of Intrigue</a></span></h3><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th> <p>DROID MODEL </p> </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/NR-1100_Slicer_Droid\" title=\"NR-1100 Slicer Droid\">NR-1100 Slicer Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 3 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Homebrew_2nd-Degree_Droids\">Homebrew 2nd-Degree Droids</span></h2><table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid #999; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#00008B;\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has been <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> per the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Untested\" title=\"Category:Untested\">Untested</a> guidelines. Whether or not it can be used is, as always, the prerogative of the Gamemaster.</b></i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p>The following are a collection of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> 2nd-Degree Droid Models created through <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a>. Their use may only be permitted with the express permission of the Gamemaster. </p><table class=\"wikitable\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <th>DROID MODEL </th> \n   <th>CHALLENGE LEVEL </th> \n   <th>PLAYER DROID? </th> \n   <th>IMAGE </th>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/0-LT_Utility_Droid\" title=\"0-LT Utility Droid\">0-LT Utility Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 0 </td> \n   <td>Yes </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr> \n  <tr> \n   <td><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/BD_Explorer_Droid\" title=\"BD Explorer Droid\">BD Explorer Droid</a> </td> \n   <td>CL 1 </td> \n   <td>No </td> \n   <td> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
